# Placeholders Directory

This directory is for custom placeholder images (optional).

## Add Custom Images (Optional)

Place these files here to use custom placeholders instead of auto-generated SVG:
- default-logo.png
- default-avatar.png  
- default-document.png
- default-file.png

## Documentation

See documentation/PLACEHOLDERS_README.md for detailed instructions.
See documentation/PLACEHOLDERS_SETUP.md for quick setup guide.

## Default Behavior

If no custom images are present, the system automatically generates SVG placeholders.
